fb.poster.avif?t=1754630303\" width=720 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657180/extras/e3738c0673de0da478ce4e281da566fb.webm?t=1754630303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657180/extras/e3738c0673de0da478ce4e281da566fb.mp4?t=1754630303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Relations</h2>Keep a good level of relationship with locals by meeting their needs to get them revolt with you against the ruler.",
